cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these proofs, the tutorial or the paper, please cite them as below."
title: "Artform Calculus: Proofs in Lean"
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: 2026-10-11
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 statements and proofs of the theorems of the textbook Artform
  Calculus; the tutorial Lean through Artform Calculus; and the paper Five
  Roles for Artforms on the type theory of the book's five roles, with the
  Lean library that checks its first part.
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - Mathlib
  - formalization
  - type theory
authors:
